00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:13.680
The man in the manor, whoever he was.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:17.760
We will find the answer to this puzzle, Jim.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.360
But be very Jim.

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:21.980
We have to be careful in here.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:25.300
There are unknown forces lurking amongst us.

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.960
Look at that face, on the wall.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:30.160
You see the demons within us!

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.080
