00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.400
to this puzzle.

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:53.000
All right.

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:56.200
Spirits of this world.

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:58.200
Speak through me.

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.520
I'm Jim.

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:00.660
This is Jim.

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:02.960
Jim is our family name.

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:05.520
And Jim must get an answer.

